	(text "VIN: regulated 5 V charger input; BAT_OUT: external protected cell / charger OUT+.\nGND connections are common. Charger and battery protection are external.\nLOAD is unregulated: approx. VIN minus diode drop, or battery minus MOSFET drop.\nD1: 1 A nominal rating; verify diode and MOSFET thermal limits for the load."
